{
  "id": "hm-ode-homogeneous",
  "libraryId": "math-one",
  "chapterId": "ode",
  "title": "一阶齐次方程代换",
  "summary": "对y'=F(y/x)使用y=ux。",
  "conditions": [
    "x≠0且方程只通过y/x依赖比值。"
  ],
  "steps": [
    "设u=y/x，写y'=u+xu'。",
    "代入后分离u与x。",
    "积分回代并检查被除去的特解。"
  ],
  "formula": "x\\frac{du}{dx}=F(u)-u",
  "pitfalls": [
    "这里“齐次”与线性齐次不是同一概念；x=0需另看。"
  ],
  "example": {
    "prompt": "自编例题：解y'=1+y/x，x>0。",
    "solution": "设y=ux，有u+xu'=1+u，因此u'=1/x，u=ln x+C，y=x(ln x+C)。"
  },
